esh strawberries</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 tablespoon sugar (optional)</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">4 small sprigs of mint&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 cup heavy whipping cream</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 tablespoons sugar (or more to suit your&nbsp;taste)</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/2 teaspoon vanilla</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 1/3 cups Granola - I used my recipe - <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#2B6CA3;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/04/08/Mikes-Mad-Good-Granola\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Mike&#39;s Mad Good Granola</a></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jpmuteen":{"pinUrl":"https://www.pinterest.com/pin/637329784746260612","isConsentPolicyActive":false,"isMobile":false,"translations":{"componentName":"Share from Pintere