r if using and set aside.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Add whipping cream, vanilla and 3 tablespoons of sugar (or more&nbsp;to taste) to a stand mixer and whip until soft peaks form.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Alternately layer the whipped cream, granola and strawberries in a pretty glass. Top the parfait with one sliced,&nbsp;fanned strawberry and a sprig of mint.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Serve immediately or refrigerate until ready to serve up to 4 hours.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-lo1v07ly":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-lo1v07ly","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-jpmuteg0":{"id":"comp-jpmuteg0","appDefinitionId":"13016589-a9eb-424a-8a69-46cb05ce0b2c","widgetId":"130165ba-4eeb-4a87-3121-a3cf2a86d2ca","isAppInClientSpecMap":true,"isViewerMode":true,"isResponsive":false,"translations":{"preloaderOverlay":{"loading":"Loading"},"errorMessageOverlay":{"reloadText":"Refresh this page","oopsText":"App Didn't Load","installErrorText":